{"seq":6,"slug":"curator-and-skill-self-improvement","title":"Hermes Curator 与 GEPA self-improvement","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/curator-and-skill-self-improvement","wordCount":1526,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"hermes-curator-与-gepa-self-improvement\">Hermes Curator 与 GEPA self-improvement</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hermes 区别于&quot;无脑日志&quot;型记忆工具的核心是 <strong>curator 后台 review</strong> + <strong>GEPA self-improvement</strong>。curator 负责让 memory 长期保持高信噪比——按 importance 重排、去重、退役 stale；GEPA（Generalized Evolutionary Policy Adaptation，ICLR-2026 paper 落地）负责让 skill 在使用反馈下自我精炼——成功率高的 skill 强化、失败的 skill 退化、长期不用的 skill 退役。两套机制结合，让 Hermes 是&quot;会自己保养自己&quot;的 personal-agent 工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  cron[Cron 触发 daily 03:00]&#10;  cron --&gt; mem_review[Memory Review]&#10;  cron --&gt; skill_review[Skill Review]&#10;  mem_review --&gt; rerank[importance re-rank]&#10;  mem_review --&gt; dedupe[去重 superseded]&#10;  mem_review --&gt; retire[退役 stale 90+天]&#10;  skill_review --&gt; gepa[GEPA 评分]&#10;  gepa --&gt; refine[skill 自动精炼]&#10;  rerank --&gt; metric[Metric Dashboard]&#10;  dedupe --&gt; metric&#10;  retire --&gt; metric&#10;  refine --&gt; metric\">flowchart TD\n  cron[Cron 触发 daily 03:00]\n  cron --&gt; mem_review[Memory Review]\n  cron --&gt; skill_review[Skill Review]\n  mem_review --&gt; rerank[importance re-rank]\n  mem_review --&gt; dedupe[去重 superseded]\n  mem_review --&gt; retire[退役 stale 90+天]\n  skill_review --&gt; gepa[GEPA 评分]\n  gepa --&gt; refine[skill 自动精炼]\n  rerank --&gt; metric[Metric Dashboard]\n  dedupe --&gt; metric\n  retire --&gt; metric\n  refine --&gt; metric</pre><p>curator 是低频但高质量的后台进程；它的输出（metric dashboard）是用户看 Hermes &quot;健不健康&quot;的窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"curator-触发机制\">Curator 触发机制</h2><p>curator 有三种触发路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Cron 触发</strong>（默认）：通过 <code>hermes init</code> 时登记的 launchd / systemd cron，默认每天 03:00 跑。</li>\n<li><strong>Event 触发</strong>：在 <code>config.toml</code> 里配 <code>[curator.events]</code> 段，可绑&quot;new session 后&quot;、&quot;memory 写入 &gt; N 条后&quot;等条件触发。</li>\n<li><strong>Manual 触发</strong>：<code>hermes curator run</code> 立刻跑一次（生产 / dry-run / 部分维度三种模式）。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[curator]&#10;schedule = &quot;0 3 * * *&quot;&#10;importance_threshold = 0.3&#10;stale_days = 90&#10;&#10;[curator.events]&#10;after_session_count = 10&#10;after_memory_writes = 50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[curator]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>schedule = \"0 3 * * *\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>importance_threshold = 0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stale_days = 90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[curator.events]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>after_session_count = 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>after_memory_writes = 50</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实际部署建议：默认 daily cron 足够；只有当 memory 增长极快（如团队场景每天数百条）才加 event 触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"memory-review-三件事\">Memory Review 三件事</h2><p>每次 curator 周期对 memory 做三件事，按顺序执行：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-importance-re-rank\">1. importance re-rank</h3><p>每条 memory entry 有一个 <code>importance</code> score（范围 0-1），初始值在写入时按规则估算（字数、显式 priority 标签）。re-rank 在每次 curator 跑时按下面公式重算综合分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{final} = importance \\times decay(t) + access\\_boost</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ccess</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">decay(t) = e^{-\\lambda t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是衰减系数（默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln(2)/30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/30</span></span></span></span></span> days），新条目分数高、老条目自然衰减。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">access\\_boost = \\log(1 + access\\_count)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ccess</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ccess</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，频繁被查询的条目分数被推回。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>查询 <code>memory.query</code> 时按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{final}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倒序返回，确保&quot;重要 + 新 + 常用&quot;的条目最先被 agent 看到。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-dedupe\">2. dedupe</h3><p>curator 用 FTS5 全文索引快速找内容近似的条目：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提取每条 entry 的 normalized text（小写、去停用词、词干化）。</li>\n<li>用 SHA-256 hash 找完全重复。</li>\n<li>对近重复（编辑距离 &lt; 阈值 + 同 tag）跑 trigram 相似度计算。</li>\n<li>同组中保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{final}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最高的，其它标 <code>superseded</code>（不删除，便于审计）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>dedupe 行为是<strong>保守的</strong>：默认只标记不删除，用户可手动 <code>hermes memory delete --status superseded --older-than 180d</code> 清理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-retire-stale\">3. retire stale</h3><p>超过 <code>stale_days</code>（默认 90 天）且 <code>access_count = 0</code> 的条目标 <code>retired</code> 状态，不再返回给 <code>memory.query</code>，但仍在数据库里以便审计 / 复活。</p>\n<p>退役公式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"should_retire = (now - created_at).days &gt; stale_days&#10;              AND access_count == 0&#10;              AND status == &#39;active&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>should_retire = (now - created_at).days > stale_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              AND access_count == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              AND status == 'active'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>被退役的条目可以 <code>hermes memory revive --id &lt;id&gt;</code> 重新激活；这种&quot;软退役&quot;避免误删。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gepa-skill-self-improvement\">GEPA：skill self-improvement</h2><p>GEPA（Generalized Evolutionary Policy Adaptation）是 ICLR-2026 paper 提出的演化策略，Hermes 把它落地到 skill 自我精炼。每条 skill 维护四个使用信号：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>采集时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>trigger_count</code></td>\n<td>命中次数</td>\n<td>每次 <code>skill.dispatch</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>success_rate</code></td>\n<td>用户后续未否认 / 未撤回的比例</td>\n<td>session 结束后回写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>user_correction</code></td>\n<td>用户在 dispatch 后明确纠正的次数</td>\n<td>session 内 detect 关键词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>last_used</code></td>\n<td>最近一次使用时间</td>\n<td>dispatch 时更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GEPA 根据四个信号在每次 curator 周期对 skill 做三类操作：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  signals[四个使用信号]&#10;  signals --&gt; strong[强化&lt;br/&gt;success_rate 高 + 频繁]&#10;  signals --&gt; weak[退化&lt;br/&gt;user_correction 多]&#10;  signals --&gt; retire[退役&lt;br/&gt;long unused]&#10;  strong --&gt; raise[提升 trigger priority]&#10;  weak --&gt; refine[自动 propose refined body]&#10;  retire --&gt; dormant[标 dormant 不再加载]\">flowchart LR\n  signals[四个使用信号]\n  signals --&gt; strong[强化&lt;br/&gt;success_rate 高 + 频繁]\n  signals --&gt; weak[退化&lt;br/&gt;user_correction 多]\n  signals --&gt; retire[退役&lt;br/&gt;long unused]\n  strong --&gt; raise[提升 trigger priority]\n  weak --&gt; refine[自动 propose refined body]\n  retire --&gt; dormant[标 dormant 不再加载]</pre><p>具体到三类操作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>强化</strong>：成功率高且频繁的 skill，被提升 <code>trigger_priority</code>，下次同 prompt 时优先于其他 skill 触发。</li>\n<li><strong>退化（自动精炼）</strong>：用户经常纠正的 skill，GEPA 会从纠正样本里提取 pattern 并 propose 一份 refined body——用户审阅后接受 / 拒绝。这是 GEPA 的核心 evolutionary loop。</li>\n<li><strong>退役</strong>：90 天未触发的 skill 标 <code>dormant</code>，不再加载到 trigger 列表，节约 mcp-serve 启动时间。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>GEPA 是 Hermes 独有的能力——其他 memory 工具或 skill 系统多是静态的，Hermes 通过 GEPA 让 skill 是&quot;活的&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"metric-dashboard-三件套\">Metric Dashboard 三件套</h2><p>curator 跑完会输出三件套 metric，可用 <code>hermes metric show</code> 查看：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Metric</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>健康范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>memory health</td>\n<td>active / superseded / retired 比例</td>\n<td>active &gt; 60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>skill hit rate</td>\n<td>触发次数 / session 数</td>\n<td>因人而异，0.3-2 算常态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>refinement count</td>\n<td>GEPA 本周期 propose 的精炼数</td>\n<td>0-5 是正常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes metric show\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> metric</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出大致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"metric @ 2026-05-14 03:00 UTC&#10;  memory:&#10;    active: 1206 (97%)&#10;    superseded: 7  (0.6%)&#10;    retired: 34  (2.7%)&#10;  skill:&#10;    total: 12 (bundled=1, custom=11)&#10;    hit_rate_7d: 0.8 (triggers/session)&#10;    refinement_proposed: 2&#10;  curator:&#10;    last_run_ms: 4231&#10;    next_run: 2026-05-15 03:00 UTC\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>metric @ 2026-05-14 03:00 UTC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  memory:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    active: 1206 (97%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    superseded: 7  (0.6%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    retired: 34  (2.7%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  skill:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    total: 12 (bundled=1, custom=11)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hit_rate_7d: 0.8 (triggers/session)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    refinement_proposed: 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  curator:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    last_run_ms: 4231</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next_run: 2026-05-15 03:00 UTC</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不健康信号：active 比例 &lt; 50% → curator 太激进 retire，调大 <code>stale_days</code>；refinement_proposed 持续 &gt; 10 → 某些 skill trigger 写太宽，检查 user_correction 高的 skill。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-docs-02_ai-llm-的关系\">与 docs/02_ai-llm/ 的关系</h2><p>需要特别澄清：本节谈的 GEPA 是<strong>工程落地视角</strong>——一条 paper 在 Hermes 这个具体工具里如何被实现为 skill 自我精炼。GEPA 的理论数学公式、policy gradient 推导、与同类 evolutionary 方法（CMA-ES / NEAT）的对比，<strong>不在本 hub 范围</strong>——这些属于 LLM/ML 理论范畴，本 hub 与 docs/02_ai-llm/ 维持零交叉的明确边界。</p>\n<p>读者如想深挖 GEPA 理论，自行查 ICLR-2026 paper；想深挖 Hermes 工程实现，进 <a href=\"../../../personal-agents/skills-self-creation/\"><code>../../../02_personal-agents/3_skills-self-creation/</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户体感-gepa-落地的实际效果\">用户体感：GEPA 落地的实际效果</h2><p>一位长期用 Hermes 的开发者，3 个月后可能观察到：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>频繁使用的 <code>commit-message-format</code> skill 优先级被推到第一，写 commit 时几乎不再被其他 skill 干扰。</li>\n<li>写得太宽的 <code>general-coding-tips</code> skill 多次被纠正后，GEPA propose 了一份更具体的 refined body（限定到 TypeScript），用户接受后 user_correction 下降到 0。</li>\n<li>三个月前写过的 <code>wedding-planning</code> skill 因为活动结束未再触发，被标 dormant 不再加载——但条目还在，万一明年再办类似事可以 revive。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种&quot;自适应&quot;行为不需要用户 actively 调参，是 GEPA 在后台默默工作的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>dedupe 误判同义不同主题</strong>：FTS5 + trigram 偶尔把&quot;同样讲 React 但讲不同子主题&quot;的两条 entry 标重复；建议加细粒度 tag 区分。</li>\n<li><strong>GEPA propose 的精炼直接 auto-accept</strong>：默认 propose-only，需要用户审阅；千万别开 auto-accept，否则 skill 会偏离原意。</li>\n<li><strong>stale_days 设太短</strong>：30 天会把许多季节性 skill 误退役；建议 90 天起步，按使用反馈调整。</li>\n<li><strong>importance score 全部手动改</strong>：违反 GEPA 自适应初衷；让 access_boost 自然推回更稳。</li>\n<li><strong>跨设备 mesh 时 curator 多机并发</strong>：必须只在一台机器跑 curator，其它机器读结果；多机并发会写冲突。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>curator 三件事：importance re-rank / dedupe / retire stale，按 cron 或 event 触发。</li>\n<li>GEPA self-improvement：四个使用信号 → 三类操作（强化 / 退化 propose refine / 退役）。</li>\n<li>Metric dashboard 三件套：memory health / skill hit rate / refinement count，是健康监控入口。</li>\n<li>与 docs/02_ai-llm/ 零交叉：本 hub 是工程落地视角，理论部分在 LLM 系列。</li>\n<li>长期效果：常用 skill 优先级上升、写宽的被自动精炼、活动结束的被 dormant。</li>\n<li>至此 Hermes 速览完结；深入模块请转 <a href=\"../../../personal-agents/\"><code>../../../02_personal-agents/</code></a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hermes Curator 与 GEPA self-improvement","id":"hermes-curator-与-gepa-self-improvement"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Curator 触发机制","id":"curator-触发机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Memory Review 三件事","id":"memory-review-三件事"},{"level":3,"text":"1. importance re-rank","id":"1-importance-re-rank"},{"level":3,"text":"2. dedupe","id":"2-dedupe"},{"level":3,"text":"3. retire stale","id":"3-retire-stale"},{"level":2,"text":"GEPA：skill self-improvement","id":"gepa-skill-self-improvement"},{"level":2,"text":"Metric Dashboard 三件套","id":"metric-dashboard-三件套"},{"level":2,"text":"与 docs/02_ai-llm/ 的关系","id":"与-docs-02_ai-llm-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"用户体感：GEPA 落地的实际效果","id":"用户体感-gepa-落地的实际效果"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hermes 7 种 terminal 后端","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/seven-terminal-backends"},"next":null}